# Code Owners for Terraform AWS Multi-Region Infrastructure
# Changes to these paths require review from the specified teams/users.

# Infrastructure changes require DevOps team review
*.tf          @devops-team
*.tfvars      @devops-team

# CI/CD pipeline changes require DevOps team review
.github/      @devops-team

# Security configuration changes require security review
.tfsec.yml    @devops-team @security-team
.checkov.yml  @devops-team @security-team

# Docker changes require DevOps review
Dockerfile    @devops-team
docker/       @devops-team
